WEBVTT

00:09.450 --> 00:11.450
Stop crying, Kyo-chan!

00:11.450 --> 00:13.160
Boys shouldn't cry!

00:13.160 --> 00:14.950
I know, but...

00:20.160 --> 00:22.910
What is that?

00:25.870 --> 00:27.080
Grandma!

00:27.620 --> 00:31.450
Th-thank you, I'm so sorry.

00:31.790 --> 00:34.080
We're almost there, you can do it!

00:34.080 --> 00:35.500
Let's go, Kyo-chan!

00:40.330 --> 00:42.410
Kyo-chan? Where are you?!

00:42.410 --> 00:43.500
Kyo-chan?!

00:43.910 --> 00:45.580
Kyo-chan!

00:47.410 --> 00:48.450
Captain?

00:48.450 --> 00:49.950
Captain Tsuchimiya?

00:51.790 --> 00:53.540
Any signals?

00:53.660 --> 00:56.450
No, no signals...

00:56.450 --> 00:59.080
but we do have unknown intruders at the sacred tree.

01:03.540 --> 01:06.200
Hey, what is that?

01:08.830 --> 01:10.830
It's kinda freaky...

01:11.700 --> 01:16.620
Asuka said once that her world was
being consumed by the Twilight,

01:16.620 --> 01:18.790
and was on the brink of destruction.

01:18.790 --> 01:21.870
So that's what she meant by consumed...

01:22.290 --> 01:25.910
The whole town's been swallowed up,
and probably the people, too.

01:26.500 --> 01:29.330
Nothing's alive in there.

01:29.330 --> 01:31.750
It's like time has stopped...

01:32.200 --> 01:34.040
So you did come here after all.

01:35.500 --> 01:36.660
Asuka!

01:38.540 --> 01:39.540
No!

01:40.160 --> 01:41.910
Don't you dare tell us to go home!

01:41.910 --> 01:46.540
We thought it over and decided
we all wanted to come help you!

01:46.540 --> 01:48.910
I am going to tell you to go home...

01:49.330 --> 01:51.830
but not right away.

01:51.830 --> 01:52.790
Huh?

01:53.160 --> 01:56.330
It's good for you to see this world.

01:56.330 --> 01:59.370
To see just what happens to a world swallowed...

01:59.370 --> 02:00.910
by the Twilight.

02:04.000 --> 02:08.750
Earphone de fusagu hiza kakaeru
I put my earphones in and curled up into a ball

02:09.200 --> 02:14.120
Sanagi no you ni busou shiteta
Armoring myself in that cocoon

02:19.950 --> 02:24.790
Me wa taikutsu na machi o mitetemo
Even if my eyes only gaze upon a boring city

02:25.410 --> 02:30.290
Kodou wa itsudatte kogareteta sora
My racing heart always longs for that sky

02:35.620 --> 02:43.950
Mada kinou no sasakure mo itamu no ni
Though yesterday's cuts still hurt

02:46.370 --> 02:51.120
Kyou o kowasu yume o mita
I dreamt that today would be destroyed

02:51.120 --> 02:56.660
Kaisoku de ukashiyou to mogaite mogaite
I struggle within, trying to burst forth as quickly as possible

02:56.660 --> 03:02.200
Kokoro no kabe wa soranetarium
The walls around my heart are a planetarium of the sky00

03:02.200 --> 03:07.450
Na mo naki tobira o wananaki akeyou
I tremble as I open the nameless door

03:07.450 --> 03:13.040
Ruritateha no you ni kizu o mitome kaze o aishitai
I want to accept my wounds
and love the wind like a blue admiral butterfly

03:13.040 --> 03:18.250
Miageteru dake no sora nante iranai
I don't want to just look up at the sky

03:18.250 --> 03:24.080
Koko ni iru watashi yo watashi o koete yuke
I beg of myself to surpass my current self

03:24.370 --> 03:29.660
Sanagi wa tokku ni mushikago kara nigeta
The cocoon has long since escaped from its cage

03:33.500 --> 03:35.080
Yu's the link?

03:35.080 --> 03:37.870
Yeah. Logically, she's our only choice, right?

03:38.620 --> 03:43.200
The device I gave to Nana still has
that function locked away, but...

03:43.200 --> 03:44.750
No, still...

03:44.750 --> 03:46.870
Huh? Who what?

03:46.870 --> 03:50.870
I hope I'm wrong, but is the Yu in this world... gone?

03:51.450 --> 03:52.870
That's correct.

03:52.870 --> 03:57.040
When the Twilight began consuming this world
ten years ago, Yu was swallowed up by it.

03:57.040 --> 03:58.790
Huh? What about me?!

03:58.790 --> 04:00.120
You too, Nana.

04:00.750 --> 04:04.410
Chloe and Mia didn't live here back then,
so I don't know about you guys...

04:04.410 --> 04:05.660
No way...

04:05.660 --> 04:08.250
So what happened to our Yu?

04:08.700 --> 04:13.910
If the linked person doesn't exist, the other members
in their party wouldn't be able to transfer.

04:14.540 --> 04:17.200
If you're here, that means that she must have...

04:21.580 --> 04:24.700
Why am I on the ground?

04:25.160 --> 04:26.540
Excuse me!

04:26.540 --> 04:30.830
Could you not jump into my body
when I'm riding a motorcycle?!

04:30.830 --> 04:33.000
Huh? Wait, Sexy Yu?!

04:33.000 --> 04:36.580
Why are you here?! This is Seriouska's Fragment!

04:36.830 --> 04:38.830
I just happened to be passing through!

04:38.830 --> 04:41.000
I wanted to check in on something.

04:41.000 --> 04:43.620
I never would've imagined I'd end up as a link.

04:43.620 --> 04:47.450
Well, I never wanted to end up inside of you, either.

04:50.500 --> 04:52.040
The town...

04:52.370 --> 04:54.450
it's gone...

04:55.660 --> 04:57.750
So this is the Twilight...

04:59.580 --> 05:03.580
The Twilight invaded this world ten years ago.

05:04.160 --> 05:08.910
We thought it would swallow up the whole world,
but for some unknown reason, it stopped.

05:09.700 --> 05:13.750
A few lucky places around the world were
spared from being devoured by the Twilight.

05:14.000 --> 05:16.450
One of those places is Akeyuki.

05:17.250 --> 05:22.330
After some research, we discovered that it was because
of an energy source that drove away the Twilight.

05:23.540 --> 05:27.330
We call it Twilight amber, and it was
lying dormant here this whole time.

05:27.330 --> 05:29.410
Directly under this sacred tree.

05:30.290 --> 05:34.700
You saw the barrier we have up around
the sacred tree to protect the amber, right?

05:35.040 --> 05:38.040
Oh, I thought it was to keep snow off.

05:38.040 --> 05:42.200
Could you use that twilight amber
to destroy the Twilight?

05:42.660 --> 05:46.910
Unfortunately, we don't have the technology
to move the twilight amber.

05:47.200 --> 05:49.160
We have our hands full just trying to survive.

05:49.660 --> 05:55.500
The Twilight uses Noizies
to erode the world little by little, but...

05:56.040 --> 05:57.200
I know.

05:57.200 --> 05:58.910
I should show you what's in here.

06:06.120 --> 06:08.000
What is this place?

06:09.200 --> 06:13.580
You know when you defeat a Clutter,
it turns into a small solid object?

06:13.580 --> 06:15.870
We're keeping those safe here.

06:15.870 --> 06:17.870
Oh, hey, this one's from Tomoya!

06:18.370 --> 06:21.370
They too are victims of the Twilight.

06:21.750 --> 06:26.040
If we defeat the King of Twilight one day,
they may return to their original forms.

06:26.620 --> 06:29.250
The chance of that happening
is extremely small, but...

06:32.040 --> 06:35.500
Okay, so how can you talk?

06:35.500 --> 06:38.950
When Nana and the others were links,
this never happened.

06:40.330 --> 06:44.950
Maybe because I'm a stronger Equalizer than you?

06:44.950 --> 06:47.950
I could always force you out of me.

06:47.950 --> 06:49.040
Huh?

06:49.040 --> 06:51.450
But I wouldn't go that far.

06:51.450 --> 06:55.910
If you're here, that means that
super cute Asuka is here!

06:55.910 --> 06:59.000
Oh, man, I can't wait to see her!

06:59.250 --> 07:02.410
Don't go flipping up her skirt all of a sudden, okay?

07:07.790 --> 07:10.910
Guess meeting up at Octave isn't going to happen...

07:12.120 --> 07:14.290
I'll head to the sacred tree, then.

07:17.950 --> 07:19.950
Are they fighting down there?

07:19.950 --> 07:21.370
They're training.

07:21.370 --> 07:23.620
Those are soldiers in our Anti-Twilight Squadron.

07:23.620 --> 07:27.450
They use special weapons that give them
the power to fight Noizies.

07:27.750 --> 07:30.790
I'm their leader.

07:30.790 --> 07:34.290
They can't use Astral Modules?

07:34.620 --> 07:37.040
Because they're not Equalizers.

07:37.040 --> 07:41.700
Just so you know, it's fairly rare
for someone to become an Equalizer.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.500
Wait, really?

07:43.500 --> 07:48.700
A heart that refuses to yield to an undesirable
situation is the source of an Equalizer's power.

07:49.410 --> 07:52.000
Traveling to an environment
you could not adapt to

07:52.000 --> 07:54.620
may have made it easier for you
to develop an Equalizer power.

07:55.410 --> 07:58.950
Let me give the three of you one of these.

07:59.410 --> 08:03.200
Unlike the one I gave to Nana a while ago,
these ones have all the features.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.120
Seriously?!

08:05.120 --> 08:07.250
We can use these to fight together!

08:07.250 --> 08:10.910
Aww, just them?! No fair!

08:10.910 --> 08:13.750
I'll take that old astral module from you, Nana.

08:13.750 --> 08:14.830
Okay.

08:15.450 --> 08:18.660
I'll explain the new features to you later.

08:18.660 --> 08:21.450
When someone jealous isn't hanging around.

08:23.040 --> 08:25.080
There is one thing you need to remember.

08:26.620 --> 08:29.750
Being an Equalizer doesn't make you special.

08:30.700 --> 08:35.120
You must acknowledge and be prepared for your world
to be the direct result of the actions you take.

08:35.120 --> 08:38.160
You must shoulder the responsibility
to change the world for the better.

08:38.410 --> 08:40.080
That is your burden.

08:41.660 --> 08:43.040
What do you mean?

08:43.040 --> 08:48.660
In a sense, it means don't think your parents and
the adults around you will protect you forever.

08:49.790 --> 08:52.160
Well, I'm not an Equalizer!

08:52.160 --> 08:54.200
I'll get them to protect me forever!

08:54.200 --> 08:55.200
God, she's annoying.

08:55.200 --> 08:56.120
Such a hassle...

08:56.120 --> 09:01.290
If you can get them to protect you,
then there's nothing wrong with relying on them.

08:56.120 --> 08:58.790
You shouldn't pout like that, Asuka-senpai!

08:58.790 --> 09:01.290
C'mon, protect me!

09:03.580 --> 09:05.750
This is the operations room.

09:05.750 --> 09:08.290
This is our Lead Operator, Mayuki.

09:09.410 --> 09:10.700
Hi there!

09:10.700 --> 09:12.700
Huh? Haven't we...

09:16.330 --> 09:19.950
From here, we keep watch over
the Twilight's expansion.

09:19.950 --> 09:24.870
We use spy cameras to survey the area,
but our most important defense is the twilight amber.

09:25.450 --> 09:29.000
When the Twilight goes on the move,
the twilight amber grows more concentrated.

09:29.000 --> 09:33.410
The reason I returned here so quickly was because of
an anomalous change in the amber's concentration.

09:33.660 --> 09:35.200
Is it a Clutter?

09:35.200 --> 09:40.330
No, a Clutter is the first stage of
the Twilight's consumption of a world.

09:40.330 --> 09:42.950
We're far past that stage now.

09:42.950 --> 09:46.790
The lifeform we detected was
far more powerful than a mere Clutter.

09:46.790 --> 09:47.950
Most likely...

09:48.290 --> 09:49.790
The King of Twilight.

09:51.450 --> 09:53.580
Huh? The King? Oh, crap...

09:53.580 --> 09:56.830
What'll happen to the world
if the King of Twilight is here?

09:56.830 --> 10:00.910
Most likely, this Fragment will be
completely destroyed.

10:01.410 --> 10:05.200
The Twilight will swallow up the few
bastions of humanity that remain.

10:05.200 --> 10:07.330
Let's go take them out, then!

10:07.330 --> 10:10.410
We can fight together and
pow-pow-pow, get rid of 'em!

10:11.370 --> 10:17.450
We do plan on taking some kind of action,
of course, but we've lost their signal...

10:17.450 --> 10:19.950
We're trying to find them again now.

10:21.250 --> 10:24.950
This Fragment had stayed stable for so long...

10:25.330 --> 10:31.000
Every safe place in the world was right in the middle
of preparing to fight the King of Twilight!

10:31.500 --> 10:34.160
But now... we're not ready!

10:38.620 --> 10:40.830
We're blocked off here, too.

10:41.160 --> 10:44.830
Geez! How the heck are we supposed to
get to the sacred tree from here?!

10:44.830 --> 10:47.500
Come on, aren't you going to do anything?!

10:49.160 --> 10:51.750
Not going to talk if you're not interested, huh?

10:51.750 --> 10:53.830
Sheesh! I can't believe you're m-

10:54.290 --> 10:56.370
Oh, I don't wear glasses...

10:56.540 --> 10:57.200
Ow!

10:57.700 --> 10:59.790
See? We don't know her!

10:59.790 --> 11:00.950
Who are you?!

11:00.950 --> 11:02.410
People!

11:02.410 --> 11:05.250
Hey! How can I get to the sacred tree?

11:05.250 --> 11:06.000
Huh?!

11:06.000 --> 11:08.000
You're after the sacred tree, are you?!

11:08.000 --> 11:10.200
Get ready to taste our wrath, King of Twilight!

11:10.200 --> 11:11.370
Get her!

11:11.910 --> 11:13.870
Huh?! H-hey!

11:14.160 --> 11:15.750
Don't let her get away!

11:18.250 --> 11:19.950
Big Sister Asuka!

11:19.950 --> 11:22.700
We're chasing the King of Twilight, can I call you-

11:23.200 --> 11:24.080
Huh?

11:24.080 --> 11:26.160
She's an acquaintance of mine.

11:26.830 --> 11:28.700
Lead her to the base, will you?

11:33.830 --> 11:34.830
Take this!

11:34.830 --> 11:36.040
Mud Bomb!

11:37.450 --> 11:38.790
Please! Don't-

11:39.250 --> 11:41.200
Next, hit 'er with the Gross Water Attack!

11:41.200 --> 11:42.660
Wha...?! No, no, no!

11:42.660 --> 11:44.540
Guys, stop attacking!
Wha...?! No, no, no!

11:44.540 --> 11:45.910
Huh? Why?!

11:46.830 --> 11:48.870
Nooooo!

11:53.700 --> 11:55.200
Follow me.

11:56.370 --> 11:58.200
I'm so done.

12:00.580 --> 12:01.500
Huh?

12:02.500 --> 12:04.330
There's another one...

12:12.620 --> 12:15.330
Big Sister Asuka! We brought your friend!

12:22.370 --> 12:23.790
We're back!

12:23.790 --> 12:25.080
Oh, there you are!

12:25.080 --> 12:28.160
You look like Sexy Yu, but that's you in there, right?

12:28.160 --> 12:29.580
I'm so glad you're-

12:29.580 --> 12:31.120
Why do you smell so bad?!

12:31.120 --> 12:33.120
Ask these kids.

12:34.290 --> 12:36.290
Hey, I know you!

12:37.580 --> 12:39.500
You look just like Big Sister Asuka!

12:39.910 --> 12:42.250
Huh? Where's the other one?

12:43.660 --> 12:46.700
Asuka! I missed you so bad!

12:46.700 --> 12:48.370
Stop this right now!

12:48.370 --> 12:49.870
Nope! Not stopping!

12:51.290 --> 12:53.660
What's wrong with Yu?

12:53.660 --> 12:58.660
She went into Sexy Yu's body,
but Sexy Yu-senpai is still there.

12:58.660 --> 13:01.120
I guess that can happen...

13:02.250 --> 13:04.910
Yukari! Why did you go out into town
without asking permission?

13:04.910 --> 13:08.870
Well, everyone said the King of Twilight was here...

13:08.870 --> 13:11.040
So we figured we'd find him and take 'im out!

13:11.040 --> 13:12.040
Yeah!

13:13.290 --> 13:16.250
I told you to get permission
before you go outside, didn't I?!

13:16.250 --> 13:19.830
As punishment, you're not allowed to leave
the living quarters until I say so, got it?!

13:19.830 --> 13:21.330
Aww!

13:21.330 --> 13:23.040
Hmph! I don't wanna!

13:23.160 --> 13:25.160
Takumi! Grab him!

13:25.160 --> 13:26.160
Hey!

13:27.620 --> 13:29.120
Hold it, Takumi!

13:29.120 --> 13:30.200
Captain!

13:31.000 --> 13:33.910
The twilight amber concentration levels
are slowly rising!

13:35.080 --> 13:37.290
Is it reacting to the King of Twilight?

13:37.290 --> 13:40.870
Maybe, but I can't say for sure what's causing it!

13:41.250 --> 13:43.660
Are they getting closer to the base?

13:44.620 --> 13:47.580
Should we go look for Takumi-kun?

13:47.580 --> 13:50.370
Seriouska looks pretty busy.

13:50.370 --> 13:52.080
Yeah, let's go.

13:52.660 --> 13:54.500
We should go, too!

13:55.620 --> 13:57.620
See you later, Seriouska!

13:57.620 --> 13:59.290
Hey, wait!

13:59.450 --> 14:03.290
Um, Captain, by Seriouska, did she mean...

14:04.450 --> 14:07.830
N-no, never mind...

14:08.200 --> 14:09.750
Hey! Stop running!

14:09.750 --> 14:11.910
Where'd you go, kiddo?!

14:11.910 --> 14:13.870
I'm over here, losers!

14:16.750 --> 14:17.870
Found you!

14:18.580 --> 14:19.660
What's wrong?

14:22.910 --> 14:24.000
Huh?!

14:24.000 --> 14:27.040
That's... Twilight, isn't it?

14:27.290 --> 14:30.700
That's what... happened to my mom...

14:36.830 --> 14:37.700
Asuka!

14:44.250 --> 14:45.450
A kid?!

14:45.450 --> 14:48.500
Wait... That kid was one of your friends, right?

14:48.500 --> 14:51.500
Huh? I thought they were with you big kids.

14:52.160 --> 14:53.870
Don't tell me that little kid...

14:53.870 --> 14:55.620
is the King of Twilight?!

14:57.080 --> 14:58.410
Wait!

15:09.790 --> 15:11.790
Twilight amber concentrations
are increasing dramatically!

15:11.790 --> 15:13.910
Twilight is consuming matter inside the base!

15:14.250 --> 15:15.910
Alert the base!

15:15.910 --> 15:18.540
Send the Anti-Twilight Squadron to the sacred tree!

15:19.370 --> 15:22.330
No response from the Anti-Twilight Squadron.

15:27.290 --> 15:28.750
Noizies!

15:29.040 --> 15:30.040
Here they come!

15:31.580 --> 15:34.370
Nana-senpai, Chloe-senpai, let's go!

15:34.830 --> 15:35.870
Of course!

15:36.700 --> 15:37.660
C'est bien!
(Sounds good!)

15:38.200 --> 15:40.750
Come forth, my twilight self!

15:44.040 --> 15:46.500
Duplicate!

16:08.870 --> 16:11.120
Your underclassman and that girl with
an attitude are pretty damn good!

16:11.120 --> 16:12.500
We gotta show 'em up!

16:12.500 --> 16:13.500
Shut up.

16:13.500 --> 16:15.750
I don't want people thinking...

16:17.000 --> 16:19.620
that the things you say are what I'm actually thinking!

16:19.790 --> 16:22.750
Everyone's got it down!

16:22.750 --> 16:24.330
No lie, kinda jealous.

16:24.330 --> 16:27.290
Yeah, I wish I could transform, too...

16:27.290 --> 16:30.750
Wait, you're Sexy Yu, right?
You can transform, can't you?

16:30.750 --> 16:32.200
Oh, right!

16:33.410 --> 16:37.500
Hey, let me transform, too. Come on!

16:39.540 --> 16:41.330
And she ignored me!

16:48.000 --> 16:49.160
Did we chase them off?

16:49.160 --> 16:50.580
I dunno...

16:51.540 --> 16:53.540
That's not good, is it?!

16:53.540 --> 16:54.370
Huh?!

17:00.580 --> 17:02.580
That's probably really bad!

17:02.580 --> 17:03.830
Let's stop them!

17:11.040 --> 17:12.750
What now?!

17:20.700 --> 17:22.040
A monster!

17:24.330 --> 17:25.790
Let's take him out together!

17:25.790 --> 17:26.580
Right!

17:26.580 --> 17:27.790
Let's give it a try!

17:27.790 --> 17:28.870
Get over there, Asuka!

17:28.870 --> 17:30.000
Okay!

17:30.250 --> 17:31.500
I'll help, too!

17:31.500 --> 17:33.500
Oh, no you won't!

17:36.200 --> 17:37.450
Hey, you!

17:38.540 --> 17:39.540
Asuka!

18:00.040 --> 18:01.120
He's tough!

18:01.120 --> 18:02.370
Come on!

18:03.000 --> 18:05.620
Hey, now's not the time to lose your cool!

18:09.660 --> 18:10.830
This is bad!

18:13.540 --> 18:15.330
Come forth, my twilight self!

18:18.450 --> 18:20.040
Duplicate!

18:22.450 --> 18:23.870
I'll get them!

18:33.410 --> 18:34.450
Take this!

18:50.080 --> 18:51.200
Take this!

19:51.250 --> 19:53.080
The twilight amber...

20:06.790 --> 20:09.870
The twilight amber is disappearing...!

20:14.580 --> 20:18.700
Emergency alert! All personnel, evacuate now!

20:18.700 --> 20:20.200
The Twilight...

20:18.700 --> 20:24.040
I repeat, emergency alert! All personnel, evacuate now!

20:20.200 --> 20:22.000
Where do we even run to?!

20:22.500 --> 20:24.040
We're doomed...

20:31.700 --> 20:33.330
Nana! Chloe! Mia!

20:33.330 --> 20:34.830
Stay with us!

20:35.910 --> 20:37.290
Asuka...

20:41.870 --> 20:44.790
I'm sorry, everyone...

20:46.250 --> 20:47.500
No...

21:05.870 --> 21:08.330
Asuka, I have a favor to ask you.

21:08.660 --> 21:11.250
Could you save Takumi for me?

21:11.250 --> 21:12.330
Huh?!

21:15.330 --> 21:17.330
Takumi, use this...

21:18.250 --> 21:22.700
and you can go to Asuka's fragment as the link.

21:23.160 --> 21:24.200
Big Sis...

21:28.450 --> 21:31.080
Nana, Chloe, Mia...

21:31.790 --> 21:33.790
I'm so glad to have met you all.

21:33.790 --> 21:37.540
I wish I could've been your friends in this Fragment.

21:38.450 --> 21:41.870
Yu, take care of the Asuka from your world.

21:42.500 --> 21:46.080
She's the Asuka dearest to my heart, too.

21:50.200 --> 21:55.950
Asuka, I was so happy to see
the possibilities I lost so long ago.

21:56.450 --> 21:58.790
And the miso soup was delicious.

21:58.910 --> 21:59.910
Wait.

22:00.120 --> 22:01.870
You're coming with us, right, Asuka?

22:01.870 --> 22:03.700
You're coming with Takumi!

22:07.790 --> 22:10.080
No matter what happens to this world,

22:10.700 --> 22:14.700
if I kill the King of Twilight,
I can save the other Fragments.

22:15.830 --> 22:16.910
Now, go!

22:18.200 --> 22:19.200
No!

22:19.540 --> 22:22.290
Let's go, Asuka! There's nothing we can do!

22:22.290 --> 22:26.160
No, please! We can't leave Asuka behind!

22:32.950 --> 22:36.500
Chloe! Set the astral module, hurry!

22:36.500 --> 22:38.330
Got it!

22:38.330 --> 22:40.540
Asuka!

22:38.330 --> 22:40.540
You're coming with us, right, Takumi?

22:40.540 --> 22:42.580
The frequency is 633.0!

22:42.580 --> 22:44.000
O-okay!

22:48.450 --> 22:49.700
You're-!

22:50.950 --> 22:55.160
Asuka!

23:06.750 --> 23:08.040
No...

23:08.040 --> 23:10.410
This isn't right! Nana, give me that!

23:10.410 --> 23:12.250
Hey- Asuka?!

23:12.750 --> 23:14.750
655.1...

23:15.040 --> 23:19.290
Take us to the space that sleeps within the twilight!

23:24.080 --> 23:25.580
Take us!

23:27.450 --> 23:29.040
Take us!

23:30.370 --> 23:31.580
Why...

23:31.580 --> 23:33.040
Why?!
